        "fac_song_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Song Yi Shi completes noncorroding flowing water, she plans to move on to emotionless flowing water. She states that the clan’s flowing water inheritance is its signature inheritance, renowned in Eastern Sea and exceptional even in the five regions. Passive defensive killer moves are rare to begin with, and by using the same core those moves can be stacked. After completing emotionless flowing water, she plans to undergo tribulation and reach rank seven.",
